OL,3,GNEWSAFinal funds approved for
OL,4,Adouble-cost arts venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinal funding has been approved for
OL,7,Frevamping England's most northern arts
OL,8,Fvenue, the price tag for which has
OL,9,Fdoubled since initial plans were
OL,10,Fconceived.
OL,12,FConservative-led Northumberland County
OL,13,FCouncil agreed a revised contribution
OL,14,Fof #7.5m for The Maltings in
OL,15,FBerwick-upon-Tweed where work is
OL,16,Fexpected to start at the end of the
OL,17,Fmonth.
OL,19,FPreviously, the Borderlands Inclusive
OL,20,FGrowth Deal board agreed an amended
OL,21,Fgrant of #28.5m towards the #36m
OL,22,Fproject on Eastern Lane.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
