OL,3,GNEWSAFinal funds approved for
OL,4,Adouble-cost arts venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project was costed at #17.7m in
OL,7,F2021. The local authority claimed the
OL,8,Ffinal bill had been impacted by
OL,9,Finflation, particularly affecting the
OL,10,Fprice of steel.
